{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-bundle-manager#card-zh","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-bundle-manager","commit":"45a6acd38c35f3c112a91f11523c6e95a1a2ed65","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bundle-manager 是 DSH 网页端插件管理器，在设置中提供插件挂载面板。它通过 Loader API 在运行时挂载或卸载可选插件，并通过 fenced API 管理挂载表。主要功能包括草稿式批量应用、命名预设、失败状态展示，以及在官方静态层与运行时管理之间导入导出。适合需要在 DSH Web 中切换可选插件组合的用户。需要 DSH Web 的 Loader 和 webServer 服务，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:974","lib/index.js:1049","lib/index.js:1904"]}
{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-bundle-manager#card-en","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-bundle-manager","commit":"45a6acd38c35f3c112a91f11523c6e95a1a2ed65","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bundle-manager adds a DSH Web settings panel for optional plugin mounts. It uses the Loader API and supports batch apply, presets, failure status, and transfers between runtime and official static layers. Requires DSH Web Loader and webServer; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:974","lib/index.js:1049","lib/index.js:1904"]}
